From: beitlab Robotics MilkV duo OS <image/patches>
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] duos arm64 sd: kernel config for remoteproc and systemd

Local change. The remoteproc lines follow 7221d232 of the Milk-V v1
`arduino` branch (CONFIG_REMOTEPROC=y, CONFIG_CVITEK_REMOTEPROC), with the
driver as a module (see 0002) and without the rpmsg/virtio options, which
no playground program uses.

CONFIG_CGROUPS=y is required by systemd (the playground image uses systemd
init, PROMPT.md "systemd"). Every other option systemd needs (DEVTMPFS,
INOTIFY_USER, SIGNALFD, TIMERFD, EPOLL, FHANDLE, UNIX, TMPFS, SYSFS,
PROC_FS) is already enabled by this defconfig or by its Kconfig default.

scripts/build-image.sh greps the built .config for CONFIG_REMOTEPROC=y and
CONFIG_CVITEK_REMOTEPROC=m and fails otherwise.
---
diff --git a/build/boards/cv181x/sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd/linux/cvitek_sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd_defconfig b/build/boards/cv181x/sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd/linux/cvitek_sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd_defconfig
index 40715c55..df9fb0c2 100644
--- a/build/boards/cv181x/sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd/linux/cvitek_sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd_defconfig
+++ b/build/boards/cv181x/sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd/linux/cvitek_sg2000_milkv_duos_glibc_arm64_sd_defconfig
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ CONFIG_NO_HZ_IDLE=y
 CONFIG_HIGH_RES_TIMERS=y
 CONFIG_PREEMPT=y
 CONFIG_LOG_BUF_SHIFT=15
+CONFIG_CGROUPS=y
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_INITRD=y
 CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_SIZE=y
 # CONFIG_SYSFS_SYSCALL is not set
@@ -222,6 +223,8 @@ CONFIG_ION_CMA_HEAP=y
 CONFIG_FB_TFT=y
 CONFIG_FB_TFT_ST7789V=y
 # CONFIG_IOMMU_SUPPORT is not set
+CONFIG_REMOTEPROC=y
+CONFIG_CVITEK_REMOTEPROC=m
 CONFIG_CV1835_SYSDMA_REMAP=y
 CONFIG_CVI_WIFI_PIN=y
 CONFIG_PWM=y
